---
import { TEAM_URL } from '../config';
---
<section id="teams">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="teams" data-reveal>
      <svg class="knight-bg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#knight"/></svg>
      <div>
        <p class="kick">For teams</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.3rem)">See and cap your team’s AI spend, <em>without</em> slowing anyone down.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Same quality bar, because every routed step is checked. One view across every agent your team runs, locally and in CI, with a budget per person or per pipeline.</p>
        <p class="pricing-line"><b>Pricing:</b> free for individual devs. Teams pay for the shared view, budgets and caps. Not final yet.</p>
        <div class="ctas" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:22px">
          <a class="pill dark magnetic" href={TEAM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Become a design partner</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
